<p>Your understanding of physiology allows you to apply your reflexes in new ways, increasing the flat damage reduction granted by Striking Stance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">30%, 41%, 51%, 61%, 70%</acronym> and causing direct critical hits (physical, mental, spells) against you to have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 12%, 17%, 21%, 25%</acronym> lower Critical multiplier (but always do at least normal damage).</p>